---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';

const updated = 'August 2026';
---

<Layout
    title="Privacy — TSNSMP"
    description="What information the TSNSMP website collects, where it goes, and how to have it removed. No tracking, no analytics, no advertising cookies."
    path="/privacy/"
    currentPage="privacy"
>
<Fragment slot="head">
    <style>
        .pp-wrap {
            max-width: 760px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 6.5rem 1.5rem 4rem;
            font-family: 'DynaPuff', cursive;
        }
        .pp-title {
            font-family: var(--font-display, 'Luckiest Guy', cursive);
            font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 7vw, 3.2rem);
            color: var(--text-primary);
            line-height: 1;
            margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
            filter: url(#chalkText);
        }
        .pp-updated {
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            opacity: 0.75;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
        }
        .pp-tldr {
            border: 2px dashed rgba(var(--s3-green-rgb), 0.5);
            border-radius: 10px 16px 12px 14px / 14px 12px 16px 10px;
            background: rgba(var(--s3-green-rgb), 0.08);
            padding: 1.1rem 1.3rem;
            margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
        }
        .pp-tldr strong { color: var(--s3-green); }
        .pp-tldr ul { margin: 0.5rem 0 0; padding-left: 1.2rem; }
        .pp-tldr li { margin: 0.3rem 0; color: var(--text-primary); }

        .pp-section { margin-bottom: 2rem; }
        .pp-section h2 {
            font-family: var(--font-display, 'Luckiest Guy', cursive);
            font-size: 1.35rem;
            color: var(--text-primary);
            margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
            letter-spacing: 0.02em;
        }
        .pp-section p,
        .pp-section li {
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            line-height: 1.75;
            font-size: 1rem;
        }
        .pp-section p { margin-bottom: 0.8rem; }
        .pp-section ul { padding-left: 1.2rem; margin-bottom: 0.8rem; }
        .pp-section li { margin: 0.35rem 0; }
        .pp-section strong { color: var(--text-primary); }
        .pp-section a {
            color: var(--s3-teal);
            text-decoration: underline;
            text-underline-offset: 2px;
        }
        .pp-key {
            display: inline-block;
            font-size: 0.82rem;
            background: rgba(var(--s3-teal-rgb), 0.12);
            border: 1px solid rgba(var(--s3-teal-rgb), 0.3);
            border-radius: 5px;
            padding: 1px 6px;
            color: var(--text-primary);
        }
    </style>
</Fragment>

<main id="main-content">
    <div class="pp-wrap">
        <h1 class="pp-title">Privacy</h1>
        <p class="pp-updated">Last updated: {updated}</p>

        <div class="pp-tldr">
            <strong>The short version</strong>
            <ul>
                <li>No tracking, no analytics, no advertising cookies — none at all.</li>
                <li>The only data we hold is what you type into an application or a gallery upload, which goes to our staff team.</li>
                <li>Accepted members appear on the public members list — you can opt out.</li>
                <li>Want anything removed? Message a staff member on Discord.</li>
            </ul>
        </div>

        <section class="pp-section">
            <h2>Who this is about</h2>
            <p>
                This covers the TSNSMP website (<strong>tsnsmp.com</strong>). We're a small
                Minecraft community running this ourselves — we're not a company and we're
                not lawyers, so this page is written plainly. If anything here is unclear,
                just ask us.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section class="pp-section">
            <h2>What your browser stores</h2>
            <p>
                We don't use cookies, and there's no analytics or tracking script on the
                site. A few small settings are saved in your browser's local storage and
                never leave your device:
            </p>
            <ul>
                <li><span class="pp-key">theme</span> — your light/dark choice</li>
                <li>Your accessibility-widget preferences (text size, contrast, reduced motion, etc.) and where you've dragged the accessibility button</li>
                <li>A note that you've seen the intro animation, and a 5-minute cache of which members are currently live on Twitch (names only)</li>
            </ul>
            <p>Clearing your browser data removes all of it.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="pp-section">
            <h2>Information you give us</h2>
            <p><strong>Member application</strong> (on the home page). You enter your Minecraft
                name, age or age range, Discord, any other socials you choose to share,
                pronouns (optional), timezone, and written answers. When you submit, it's
                sent through a small server function and posted to our private staff Discord
                for the team to review. We also fetch your Minecraft avatar from a skin
                service to attach it to the post.</p>
            <p><strong>Moderator application</strong> (<a href="/apply/">/apply/</a>). Similar
                details plus more written answers. These are stored in our database
                (Google Firebase) and posted to Discord.</p>
            <p><strong>Gallery submissions</strong> (<a href="/gallery/">/gallery/</a>). The
                image, a title, an optional description and an optional name. Uploads go to
                our Firebase storage and are reviewed by staff before appearing on the site.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="pp-section">
            <h2>The public members list</h2>
            <p>
                If you're accepted, your Minecraft name, pronouns, chosen colour and Twitch
                link (if you've shared one) are shown publicly on the <a href="/players/">Players</a>{' '}
                page and the home page. You can opt out with the checkbox on the application
                form, or ask a staff member to take you off the list at any time.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section class="pp-section">
            <h2>Other services involved</h2>
            <p>Running the site means your browser (or our server) talks to a few outside
                services. Each has its own privacy policy and may see your IP address:</p>
            <ul>
                <li><strong>Discord</strong> — where applications are sent</li>
                <li><strong>Google / Firebase</strong> — database, image storage, and staff sign-in</li>
                <li><strong>Cloudflare</strong> — hosts the site; its servers log IP addresses and request info for security and abuse prevention</li>
                <li><strong>minotar.net</strong> — Minecraft skins and avatars</li>
                <li><strong>Twitch</strong> — checking whether members are live, and stream thumbnails</li>
                <li><strong>Google Fonts</strong> and <strong>Modrinth</strong> (mod links on the Resources page)</li>
            </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="pp-section">
            <h2>Age</h2>
            <p>
                TSNSMP is an <strong>18+ community</strong>. Applications from anyone under
                18 are not accepted, and you're asked to confirm your age when you apply.
                If you're under 18, please don't submit an application or share personal
                details with us.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section class="pp-section">
            <h2>Keeping and deleting your data</h2>
            <p>
                Applications stay in our Discord and records while we consider them, and for
                a while afterwards in case you re-apply or we need the context. If you want
                your application, or your entry on the members list, deleted — message a
                staff member on Discord and we'll take care of it.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section class="pp-section">
            <h2>Changes</h2>
            <p>
                If what we collect changes, we'll update this page and the date at the top.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section class="pp-section">
            <h2>Contact</h2>
            <p>
                Reach us on our community Discord, or on Bluesky at{' '}
                <a href="https://bsky.app/profile/tsnsmp.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">@tsnsmp.com</a>.
            </p>
        </section>
    </div>
</main>
</Layout>
